OL,3,GNEWSA'I enjoy my job' - McDonald's
OL,4,Aworker, 91, praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 91-year-old man says he has no plans
OL,7,Fto stop working at a fast-food
OL,8,Frestaurant, where his dedication to
OL,9,Fcustomers has earned him widespread
OL,10,Fpraise.
OL,12,FEric Edwards from Coventry has been a
OL,13,Fpart-time customer experience manager
OL,14,Fat the McDonald's at the city's
OL,15,FGallagher Retail Park for more than
OL,16,Feight years.
OL,18,F"If it's something you're doing and you
OL,19,Fcan still do it reasonably well, enjoy
OL,20,Fit and it keeps you going, why stop?"
OL,21,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
