OL,3,GNEWSA'I enjoy my job' - McDonald's
OL,4,Aworker, 91, praised
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd customers agree. After one family
OL,7,Fleft glowing feedback on social media,
OL,8,Fothers added their own praise - and the
OL,9,Fpost has since gone viral. "It has
OL,10,Fsnowballed," Edwards added.
